Hi,

for all of you who have problems resuming from S3, please check
whether you have a (bootable) CD-ROM/DVD in your drive during
resume. My machine crashes reliably on resume if I have any
bootable media in my DVD drive and it sometimes crashes even
with unbootable media.

Just wanted to mention it because more people on this list
have different S3 experiences on the same hardware.


